<p>Turn your body into pure flame, increasing your fire resistance by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">25%, 34%, 41%, 47%, 52%,</acronym> burning any creatures striking you in melee for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">14, 19, 22, 26, 28</acronym> fire damage, and randomly launching up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> slow-moving fire bolt(s) per turn at targets in sight, each dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> fire damage.</p><p>The projectiles safely go through your friends without harming them.</p><p>The damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.</p>